### 1. Test unauthenticated access (expect redirect 302 to /login)
GET http://localhost:8080/books

### 2. Login as regular user (extracts JSESSIONID)
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=user&password=user123

### 3. Login as administrator (extracts JSESSIONID)
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

username=admin&password=admin123

### 4. Admin tries to access administration area (expect 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/admin

### 5. Regular user tries to access administration area (expect 403 Forbidden)
GET http://localhost:8080/admin

### 6. CSRF Test: POST without CSRF token (expect 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:8080/books
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Forged Book&genre=NOVEL&year=2026
